## Iron
component-iron = Iron
    .genitive = iron
component-iron-description-novice = A metal attracted by magnets. Pure iron is soft; almost all the “iron” around us is steel or cast iron — alloys of iron and carbon.
component-iron-description-school = Iron is ferromagnetic — that is why an induction hob heats cast-iron cookware. It melts at 1538 °C.
